invariant: INV-5
file: pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_test
reason: the chain call stops comparing its count with chain_max, so a
  file of more blocks than the caller's entries writes past the caller's
  array. test_chain_counts gives twelve and thirteen entries and a file
  of one block more, and requires CH_EINVAL.

--- old
        if (next != PEM_BLOCKS_READ || count == chain_max || count == UINT8_MAX ||
--- new
        if (next != PEM_BLOCKS_READ || count == UINT8_MAX ||
